[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5160.07, "timestamp": "01:26:00", "text": "复活。很可能确实如此。等等，我们需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5162.629, "timestamp": "01:26:02", "text": "告诉她。我打算这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5164.47, "timestamp": "01:26:04", "text": "去卡车那儿，对吧？上卡车。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5167.27, "timestamp": "01:26:07", "text": "是的。上卡车。是的。我们该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5171.59, "timestamp": "01:26:11", "text": "之后还能恢复吗？我也这么认为。是的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5172.87, "timestamp": "01:26:12", "text": "那么我们还没有完成第一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5175.83, "timestamp": "01:26:15", "text": "萃取。兄弟，我不知道规则。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5178.31, "timestamp": "01:26:18", "text": "哇。那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5182.189, "timestamp": "01:26:22", "text": "不，你不能。仅供您参考"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5183.739, "timestamp": "01:26:23", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq why are your eyes the only thing glowing!?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5185.51, "timestamp": "01:26:25", "text": "呃，所以，我要去摆弄一下……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5189.35, "timestamp": "01:26:29", "text": "所以，请允许我暂时离开一下。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5194.667, "timestamp": "01:26:34", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "T_T"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5201.91, "timestamp": "01:26:41", "text": "我的天哪。乔克。为什么只有你的眼睛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5203.59, "timestamp": "01:26:43", "text": "发光？哦，原来是个恐怖游戏。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5206.95, "timestamp": "01:26:46", "text": "就像我身处黑夜之中。就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5210.47, "timestamp": "01:26:50", "text": "现在玩恐怖游戏了。你可以做到。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5214.07, "timestamp": "01:26:54", "text": "去做。我们走吧。你是国王"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5215.91, "timestamp": "01:26:55", "text": "失败者。好的。她听不见，但我能听见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5218.629, "timestamp": "01:26:58", "text": "我仍然可以说，我们走吧。你是"}]